才觉得自己是傻逼。当时我很瞧不起吸冰毒的人，觉得吸冰毒干嘛，还不如致幻剂。最开始我对致幻剂有兴趣的是lsd，后面到dmt thc这类。深入研究之后我开始幻想自如果溜冰能获得的愉悦感是怎么样。","tweet_id":"","conversation_id":"","is_reply":false,"reply_to_id":"","reply_type":"","has_quoted":false,"quoted_id":"","has_media":false,"media_keys":[],"author_name":"Spring风","author_username":"@Spr1ngW1nd","author_avatar":"https://web.archive.org/web/20220605103346im_/http://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1533089175611682817/9-II5wqU_normal.jpg","body_text":"我想起来我最开始的时候觉得吸毒吸成瘾的毒品的都是傻逼。但是我后面自从深入研究之后我才觉得自己是傻逼。当时我很瞧不起吸冰毒的人，觉得吸冰毒干嘛，还不如致幻剂。最开始我对致幻剂有兴趣的是lsd，后面到dmt thc这类。深入研究之后我开始幻想自如果溜冰能获得的愉悦感是怎么样。","images":[],"wanted_images":[],"embedded_images":[],"wanted_videos":[],"embedded_videos":[],"wanted_avatars":[],"remove_urls":[],"embedded_remove_urls":[],"is_virtual":false,"is_pinned":false},{"file":"20220605101908_twitter_com_Spr1ngW1nd_status_1533392973756391424.html","timestamp":"Sun Jun 05 10:19:08 +0000 2022","date":"Sun Jun 05","time":"10:19:08","text":"还有就是 12 24的话其实效果上来说其实更像是k粉","tweet_id":"","conversation_id":"","is_reply":false,"reply_to_id":"","reply_type":"","has_quoted":false,"quoted_id":"","has_media":false,"media_keys":[],"author_name":"Spring风","author_username":"@Spr1ngW1nd","author_avatar":"https://web.archive.org/web/20220605101908im_/http://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1533089175611682817/9-II5wqU_normal.jpg","body_text":"还有就是 12 24的话其实效果上来说其实更像是k粉","images":[],"wanted_images":[],"embedded_images":[],"wanted_videos":[],"embedded_videos":[],"wanted_avatars":[],"remove_urls":[],"embedded_remove_urls":[],"is_virtual":false,"is_pinned":false},{"file":"20220710105227_twitter_com_Spr1ngW1nd_status_1546084933436948480.html","timestamp":"Sun Jul 10 10:52:27 +0000 2022","date":"Sun Jul 10","time":"10:52:27","text":"@Paradeus123 otto","tweet_id":"","conversation_id":"","is_reply":false,"reply_to_id":"","reply_type":"","has_quoted":false,"quoted_id":"","has_media":false,"media_keys":[],"author_name":"Spring风","author_username":"@Spr1ngW1nd","author_avatar":"https://web.